{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "430883df4617574add3bce6d7cc2c223efe32bfe678a6c89be5dc666d669e486", "ja": "（『雪と氷』がテーマの公演を明日に控えて、\nあずささんは真剣に資料をチェックしている……）", "zh": "（明天就是以『雪与冰』为主题的公演了，\n梓小姐很认真地在确认资料……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2fae34113d383e5a01e79986df24c178490c07d3efe1b4cdb4bf1d8261c3d27a", "ja": "あずささん。気になるところがあったら、\n何でも言ってくださいね。", "zh": "梓小姐，\n要是有什么问题都可以问我喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "a66eab7b781bd96ca17feb5735a9d622a9c11282fb63e110b446b13d4ef6f27e", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nじつはひとつ、お聞きしておきたいことがあって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n其实我有件事情想要请教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "101be9606d34f35737ac9e5b6a556798c96961820b201ad56aef14c3656bcd62", "ja": "今回のステージセット、雪や氷がモチーフの\nオブジェがたくさんありますけれど……。", "zh": "这次的舞台布景，\n有很多以冰雪为概念的装饰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "41b310de51465d79a0f7787893ea8378122c21a0cae80f2b494fb2ada744fd79", "ja": "もしかして、本当の氷を使っていたりするんですか？", "zh": "那些装饰，该不会真的是用冰做的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ad57ea21f4da41f60d7cb7f98acb33f6b619830d2c922177ebb1379370a1f9d8", "ja": "えっ？　いえ、さすがに全部ダミーですよ。\n溶けちゃいますからね。", "zh": "什么？不是的，那些全都是假道具喔。\n不然会融化的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "8adbdca97830ad35d542255f7dd57b8d5721ef4ccf4a66ef5a158e144b03a348", "ja": "そ、そうですよね？　よかった……。\nごめんなさい、変なことを聞いてしまって。", "zh": "果、果然不是真的吗？太好了……\n对不起，问了这么奇怪的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "690d264a518890e20f1b33d1b64598d1d56e4b5800659b7145cd9a905fba6311", "ja": "構いませんけど、どうしてそう思ったんです？", "zh": "没关系，不过为什么你会觉得是真的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "7c1e146848e34879d8a1317860528df87e28e57970c460ac342d0153dd0c6633", "ja": "それは、あの……。", "zh": "这是因为，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "0e4a1d129cbdb74bbd83bf6cc3674af8b2e439b37ad94a905fe87e8a440268de", "ja": "{$P$}さん、さっきの音合わせの時、\nくしゃみをしていましたよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n刚刚试音的时候，你打喷嚏了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ae61cc0cf871e9e86f5b891ceee93c3d7f8b1f50a72544058a91a5d958fa90b5", "ja": "（見られてたのか……）", "zh": "（被看见了吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "3c1e95595b54d62f90fcaff6946602634439dfa54327fe3e30de0b13efa793af", "ja": "この会場も全体的に、少し寒いような気がして。\nそれで、つい……。", "zh": "我也觉得这座会场整体上有点冷，\n所以才会那么问……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c51dd580998eabab242f6451b1ce080b3113a1b8a14f0791046e240ef69f13c6", "ja": "なるほど。今回のセットはよく出来てますから、\n見ているだけで、寒い気がするんだと思います。", "zh": "原来如此。毕竟这次的布景做得很棒，\n光是看着就会觉得冷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "79c8e39c0cbd29ad898460390beb9c820bb01f3cba38935f450fc69fb9abe926", "ja": "でも、安心してください。公演本番ではファンの\n熱気で、客席もあたたまるでしょうし……。", "zh": "不过，请你放心吧。\n正式演出时，粉丝的热气肯定会让观众席暖和起来才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6222c0e3414cdc2710ae71793474536bf89d3860d78144d55a5e2ced0437bd9e", "ja": "俺のくしゃみは、昨日の泊まり込み作業の影響が\nちょっと出ただけですから。", "zh": "我只是因为昨晚在这边过夜赶工，\n有点着凉才会打喷嚏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "d8e74ec8ac9ad67fe1717da44b5f45ff7505adb835aba333d16a699fb772848c", "ja": "あら、またそんな無理をなさっていたんですね？\nもう……。", "zh": "哎呀，你又这样勉强自己了吗？\n真伤脑筋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "00d2fa8e5c6adbfdcd8382aafc27ba08043b3e8fc0d443a86459cd5237a5c542", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nちょっと、手を出してみていただけますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n可不可以请你把手伸出来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a7fbb4dfb4c1a3c3bd8d77f5e08b89ea9f0dcd83b85d9f3372cffb1f6437d07e", "ja": "え？\nえっと……こうですか？", "zh": "咦？\n呃……像这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_1018", "source_sha256": "e965dc741ba29a5f5ba8fc40c4cf673a72d703520a91a568ab25b2d9f712e4ee", "ja": "手を差し出す", "zh": "伸出手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2000_se", "source_sha256": "3b37d4075f76585029bc2549083e91d3be04f4e5fd3e90584d7ca01136f0a8e0", "ja": "（ぴたっ）", "zh": "（紧贴）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2001_010azu", "source_sha256": "f2196bc06d50411b15dbff158964dbc345f9b4bafdae967531dfb34473a0b5b8", "ja": "まあ、こんなに冷えきって……。\nこれでは本当に、風邪をひいてしまいます。", "zh": "哎呀，你的手好冰……\n这样下去真的会感冒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2002_p", "source_sha256": "4f72ebc220752d41c872a0440253cf300006f5582ac9e68dec2017a7dc01b2cb", "ja": "い、いえ、そんな。\n大丈夫ですよ、仮眠もとりましたし……。", "zh": "不、不会的，没那么严重。\n我不要紧啦，而且也有小睡一会儿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2003_010azu", "source_sha256": "8c3f4c8c62be593015bef269703ac53d3f39da47a89c19e146ed527ed32deae8", "ja": "いけません。\n少しこのまま、温めさせてくださいね？", "zh": "不行。\n再让我继续帮你暖暖手吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2004_p", "source_sha256": "a80e1d39261446f2cc4aab8ba12e6f93b93a4ee8ee6bb7a4dc6b3eb06118e422", "ja": "でも、あずささんの手を冷やすわけには……。", "zh": "可是，我不能让梓小姐的手受寒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2005_010azu", "source_sha256": "79b82787ab39518ceeb16c472ee8772d11b04b2cba9c0bf1b242122bd002ae72", "ja": "安心してください。私、平熱は高いほうなんです♪\nそれに……。", "zh": "请你放心。其实，我的体温偏高喔♪\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2006_010azu", "source_sha256": "b0dfe37b4cfe7b04782c68a619fbc8c173d8160bfe15fed60ab69dfab5a8d6be", "ja": "今回の『雪と氷』がテーマの公演。みなさんを\n温めるのは、舞台に立つ私の役目ですから。ふふっ♪", "zh": "这次的公演以『雪与冰』为主题，\n而我在舞台上的职责就是为大家带来温暖，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2007_p", "source_sha256": "fd771bd0245e5af57f76776b127636183d73f028adbce45aab3531f18f7e49e0", "ja": "（……握られた手を通して、\n温もりが伝わってくる……）", "zh": "（……从她握着我掌心的双手，\n传来了阵阵温暖……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0104_2008_p", "source_sha256": "be4f2cdd2d9671dcdeca45c72e5a32986bfcb22edf5de6ad1a193809f72213d1", "ja": "（きっと明日は、その優しさが\n客席のすみずみまで届くだろう！）", "zh": "（她的这份温柔，\n明天肯定也能传遍观众席吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
